  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Even with the new feature to lock the camera, its sill possible to interact with it/accidentally unlock it when moving your hands around and gesturing (this is especially impactful when doing sign language in VR). A toggle option to 100% disable interaction with the camera from the main menu (or similar) would be very useful - so we can have the camera out to see ourselves (important for checking FBT is working correctly/gesturing at the correct areas of your face etc) and not risk accidentally taking a random photo or unlocking it and dragging it around.",
